<title>UK: London gold fixes shade firmer, tone still bearish.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes shade firmer, tone still bearish.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $339.25 vs 11-month low of $338.95 earlier. Some early buying seen in New York failed to sustain move higher. Bearish despite physical interest.</p>
<p>SILVER - Down a cent at $4.64/$4.65 following 25-month low fix.</p>
<p>Technically weak.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Mostly steady around $372.75/$373.75, down $0.25</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $1.00 at $157.75/$158.75.</p>
</text>
